{"id":"wb-7-1861","name":"琼海关旧址","title":"琼海关旧址","status":"catalogue","text":"琼海关旧址位于海南省海口市龙华区，是全国重点文物保护单位。名录记载的时代为1937年，文物类型为近现代重要史迹及代表性建筑，本条按第七批名录收录。","sourceUrl":"http://www.ncha.gov.cn/module/download/downfile.jsp?classid=0&filename=1406261621052128423.pdf","sourceName":"公布名录","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7ad91ac67023ebb5ab709be0.jpg","title":"Qionghaiguan Site 琼海关旧址 03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qionghaiguan_Site_%E7%90%BC%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%B3%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Qionghaiguan_Site_%E7%90%BC%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%B3%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"JULIANISME","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​琼海关旧址，位于海南省海口市龙华区得胜沙路4号","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}